Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-bin (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-support (= ${binary:Version}),
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-${kernel:Flavour} | nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-dkms,
Recommends:
 libgl1-nvidia-legacy-96xx-glx,
 xorg-server-legacy-nvidia-12,
Provides: nvidia-legacy-driver
Conflicts: nvidia-driver, nvidia-legacy-driver
Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver metapackage (GeForce 2/3/4 Ti series (NV1x, NV2x))
 The 96.43.23 driver from the NVIDIA 96xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for noble.
 .
 Supported hardware: GeForce 2/3/4 Ti series (NV1x, NV2x).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2012. Forward-port target kernel 6.12 LTS / xserver ABI 12. High risk.
 .
 SECURITY WARNING: this driver series receives NO security updates from NVIDIA
 and has publicly known, unpatched vulnerabilities. Install it only on isolated
 or offline systems, or where the hardware leaves no supported alternative.
 debconf shows this warning again at install time.
 .
 This package is BEST-EFFORT for ubuntu2404: the shipped X server ABI
 (25) is newer than what this driver officially supports
 (12). IgnoreABI is enabled automatically. Test before relying on it.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 96.43.23 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 96.43.23 driver.

Package: libgl1-nvidia-legacy-96xx-glx
Architecture: amd64 i386
Multi-Arch: same
Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 96.43.23
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.


