Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-support
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-support-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96.43.23 driver — kernel/X integration glue
 Ships the nouveau blacklist, the modprobe alias, the initramfs hook, the udev
 rules and the /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d snippet for the 96.43.23 driver.

Package: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-6.11.0-9-generic
Architecture: amd64
Section: non-free/kernel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, linux-image-6.11.0-9-generic
Provides: nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-6.11.0-9-generic,
 nvidia-legacy-96xx-kernel-modules
Description: NVIDIA legacy 96xx prebuilt module for Linux 6.11.0-9-generic
 The nvidia/-modeset/-drm/-uvm modules from the 96xx series,
 compiled for the 6.11.0-9-generic kernel ABI. No toolchain needed on the target.
